==English==

===Verb===
'''talk like an apothecary'''

# {{intransitive|idiom|1811}} To use hard or [[gallipot]] words: from the assumed [[gravity]] and [[affectation]] of knowledge generally put on by the gentlemen of this profession, who are commonly as [[superficial]] in their learning as they are pedantic in their language.

